==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|retrōgressus}}, perfect active participle of {{m|la|retrōgradior||retrograde}}.

===Verb===
{{en-verb|es}}

# {{label|en|intransitive}} To [[return]] to an [[earlier]], [[simpler]] or [[worse]] [[condition]]; to [[regress]].
# {{label|en|intransitive}} To go [[backwards]]; to [[retreat]].
# {{label|en|intransitive}} To return to bad [[behaviour]]; to [[relapse]].

